<title>NETHERLANDS: Randstad to split shares on August 1.</title>
<headline>Randstad to split shares on August 1.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Temporary employment agency Randstad NV said on Monday it would split its shares on August 1, 1997. The 2.5-for-one split had been announced in March.</p>
<p>The firm said it wants to broaden its shareholder base and increase liquidity in the stock by splitting the shares.</p>
<p>Randstad shares were trading at 198.20 guilders on Monday morning, down 0.60 guilders compared to Friday's close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
